Article 3
The objectives of protection of women and children from acts of violence, are to: a. prevent acts of violence against women and children including human trafficking;
b. eliminate all forms of acts of violence and exploitation against women and children;
c. protect and provide a sense of security for women and children; d. provide services to women and children from acts of violence, reporters, and witnesses; and
e. empower women and children victims of acts of violence to be more empowered physically, psychologically, socially and economically.

